      "reasons": [
        "The packet supports clinical field research as a setting with logistical and ethical challenges, but it does not define field research in general as research done in community/local settings rather than from a distance.",
        "“Work in the places where they live” and the contrast with “from a distance” go beyond the packet; it mentions remote locations, community impact, and dialogue, but not that this is the meaning of the term.",
        "The reference to respectful dialogue is only partly supported: the packet says ‘symmetrical dialogues’ and that local leaders/community residents were often not consulted, but it does not establish this as a standard element of the term’s definition."
